about enough room for the one house standing to your east.  The cozy
cottage's door is open and inviting, but the inside looks very dark.
The Widmans River flows right past your feet, and you could probably
enter the water to the south.  A path bordered by shrubs leads up to the
house, and the easiest way back into the hills lies above.
