#11004
Smithery~
   Devastation greets your eyes.  The forge has been blasted apart,
along with most of the back door, and hammers, tongs and anvils lie
strewn about in one gigantic mess.  The smith's bed still smolders.  The
place has been utterly wrecked, by more than one man, you would think,
from all the tracks in the dust.  A garden lies to the east, and the
front door to the west.
~
