bed~
   Ha!  Lucky, you were always lucky!

   Under the pillow is a half-written letter, unaddressed.
The bits of text that aren't smudged, burnt, and smeared 
tell tale of the smith/mage Gabadiel's masterwork: a sword
of unequalled power, and two swords that came before, 
discarded as 'Not quite what I was working towards'.

   Looking around, you notice a distinct lack of any 
swords.  You think you may have a motive now...
~
