#11057
Common Room~
   A large fireplace warms this room in great waves of heat, fighting
the chill drafts that seep in through the windows on the west and north
sides.  A few benches and tables are clustered in the center for the use
of the locals.  It is fairly plain, for a popular gathering place.  The
arch leads east.
~
