#11059
A Rocky Slope~
   This slope is fairly gentle and easy to walk on, despite the loose
shale and gravel.  To the east is a high ridge you could stand on, and
to the west a ledge near two trails leading up and down into the
mountains.  High above you to the west looms the ominous dark peak,
which seems to radiate a sense of hopelessness...
~
