#11060
Ledge~
   This ledge overlooks a small path that leads up and down from here.
Below, the path heads down to a flat area where a small cottage lies
nestled in the mountains, smoke rising from it in a curling line.
Above, the path seems to lead toward the dark peak piercing the sky.  A
few boot prints in the earth seem to lead down toward the cottage.
