#11061
Outside of a Cottage~
   Now that you are closer to the cottage, you see that the smoke is not
coming from its chimney but from the gutted ruins of the building
itself.  Something torched this place, badly.  You see no signs of life
among the wreckage.  You could enter, with caution, through one of the
particularly large holes in the wall to the west.  The path leads up.
