#11062
Torched Cottage~
   This whole place is still smoldering from whatever tried to burn it
to the ground.  Near the center of the ruin lies the burnt and shriveled
corpse of a man, outstretched and blackened.  A trapdoor is set into the
floor beneath the ashes.  There's not much else to see; whatever
destroyed this place did its job very well.  The way out lies east.
~
