#11063
Mountain Trail~
   This mountain trail leads straight up into the evil-looking
mountains.  High above you, one peak seems to radiate danger and fear,
and the trail seems to lead straight toward it.  You wonder whether it
is wise to continue...  The trail climbs higher to the west, and back
down to the ledge below.
~
