#11068
Small, Dangerous Path~
   Too late, you realize that this wider ledge leading north to the
darkened cave is an ideal spot for an ambush.  It does, however, give
you a beautiful panoramic view of the whole mountain range, its peaks
marching away into the haze.  Breathtaking!  The cave lies north, and
the path leads down.
