#11069
Cave Entrance~
   You are standing in the entrance of a simply huge cave!  Its size is
stunning!  Burnt bones and debris of wood and metal lie all about, and
giant claw marks score the ground, leading deeper into the cave.  Two
tunnels lead off from here, one up and one down, and the claw marks lead
both ways.  The ledge lies to the south.
~
