#11074
Sloping Tunnel~
   A bright light shines from the north, in stark contrast to the
darkness of the tunnel above.  You break out in a sweat in the
overwhelming warmth, and the musky odor has grown so strong that it
drowns out everything else and makes it hard to breathe.  Something in
your gut begins to squirm uncomfortably as you wonder what lies ahead...
