#11075
Lair~
   This place is huge, as it should be, considering the great bulk of
its owner.  But instead of the usual carnage and heap of gold you might
expect in a dragon's lair, this one is subtly decorated with tapestries,
drapes and other comforts of civilized life.  There is even a
dragon-sized bed, no doubt conjured into being by its elder owner, and
the scent of fine wine hangs in the air.  The tunnel lies to the south.
~
