#11080
A small path through the brush~
   A small, well-traveled path leads east through the thick brush, the
branches on either side broken and pushed back by something passing this
way again and again.  Judging by the size of the opening, you're not too
sure what goes through here, and you're not sure you want to find out.
The mountain ridge lies to the west.
~
