#11089
The Shaman's Hut~
   This hut is a little more lavish than the rest.  A carved legruin is
set into the dirt floor before a window in the south wall, and
tapestries hang from where the walls meet the ceiling, draping the room
in cloaks of color.  Bundles of dried herbs and small bones dangle from
the rafters.  A doorway leads west.
~
